msgctxt "page:guides/rl-environments/index.html"
msgid ""
"You can also pass capture Evidence JSON saved by REA's {ph0} or HAR inspection. "
"Evidence is the saved recording with its source information. The build reads local "
"data and writes the folder without contacting the app. Add {ph1} to review the report "
"without writing files."
